[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m ### Step 1: Define variables
[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m Let:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m - $ s $ be her walking speed (in km/h)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m - $ t $ be the time spent in the coffee shop (in minutes)
