[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m ### Step 2: Use second scenario
[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m She walks **at speed $ s + 2 $ km/h**, and total time is 2 hours and 24 minutes = **2.4 hours**.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m 
