[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m ### Step 5: Compute the Sum
[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m Now sum these numbers:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=147947)[0m 
